This directory is a byte-for-byte copy of the Discord reference plugin's source.

Its home is a SIBLING REPOSITORY — its own git repository, its own go.mod,
importing nothing of this module — because a plugin author's project is not
inside this repository, and an example that lived here would quietly be allowed
to cheat.

  repository   obelo-plugin-discord
  local path   ../obelo-plugin-discord  (relative to this repository's root)
  remote       none — it is a local repository on the maintainer's machine
  commit       d50722bc6249297e2218a67cf49bfc47978533eb
               "The Discord Event sink: Obelo's reference Installed plugin"
  taken        2026-09-17 (.scratch/plugin-system issue 14)

Why the copy exists: a clean clone of the server does not have the sibling, and
every test in internal/plugins/discordtest and internal/api/discord_plugin_test.go
must still run. The sibling is PREFERRED when it is checked out, so that an author
editing it sees this suite react; when it is, TestTheVendoredCopyMatchesTheSibling
compares every file here with its original and fails on any difference.

To re-vendor after changing the sibling: copy each file in
discordtest.VendoredFiles over the copy here, and update the commit above.
